hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1690","Narrated to us Abu Musa: Narrated to us 'Amr ibn 'Asim: Narrated to us Hammam: From Qatadah: From Muwarriq: From Abu al-Ahwas: From 'Abdullah (RA): From the Prophet (ﷺ), who said:\n\n*\The prayer of a woman in her private chamber is better than her prayer in her house"","" and her prayer in her house is better than her prayer in her courtyard.\""*\n\nCHAPTER:"""""
